PASS the app reaches the gateway from its origin (the real preflight is the first OPTIONS in the exchange list below)
PASS register through the UI: cross-origin credentialed POST succeeds (no CORS error), roles land the host
  cookie: httpOnly=true sameSite=Strict path=/identity/auth secure=true domain=localhost
PASS Identity set the httpOnly refresh cookie through Kong; scripts cannot read it; no token in web storage
PASS reload restores the session through POST /identity/auth/refresh (credentials: include) and stays signed in
PASS sign out revokes: POST /identity/auth/logout 2xx and the cookie is gone
PASS a wrong password through the gateway is a neutral 401, not a CORS failure

